{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-16 10:49:20 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: scribe_mcp_repair_2] Completed fixes for both issues:  FIX 1 - Tool logs no longer go to PROGRESS_LOG: - Modified `log_read()` in `tools/read_file.py:1788-1805` to be a no-op in non-sentinel mode - Tool events (read_file_error, scope_violation) now only go to TOOL_LOG.jsonl via finalize_tool_response() - Deprecated `_log_project_read()` function with warning  FIX 2 - Auto-rotation now uses full Jinja template with hash chain info: - Modified `_execute_rotation_with_fallbacks()` in `tools/rotate_log.py:961-1000` to:   1. Get hash chain info from state_manager   2. Compute current file hash before rotation   3. Build rotation_context with create_rotation_context()   4. Generate template via _build_template_content()   5. Pass template_content to rotate_file() - Also improved fallback error path (lines 1069-1099) to try template generation before using minimal header | files_changed=[\"tools/read_file.py\", \"tools/rotate_log.py\"]; fixes=[\"tool_log_routing\", \"rotation_template\"]; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_mcp_repair_2/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-16T10:49:20.750050+00:00_de862209", "timestamp": "2026-01-16T10:49:20.750083+00:00"}
