{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-16 10:57:31 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: scribe_mcp_repair_2] Analysis complete. Identified 5 duplicate selector pairs to merge: 1. .c-modal / .modal (lines 21-36 vs 51-66) + ::before pseudo-elements (lines 39-48 vs 68-77) 2. .c-modal__backdrop / .modal-backdrop (lines 90-97 - ALREADY MERGED) 3. .c-modal__close / .modal-close (lines 209-222 vs 225-237) + :hover (both blocks) 4. .c-modal__body / .modal-body (lines 259-263 vs 266-270) 5. .c-modal__footer / .modal-footer (lines 284-292 vs 295-303)  NOTE: .c-modal__header/.modal-header and .c-modal__content/.modal-content have DIFFERENT CSS (using different design tokens) so cannot be merged. | already_merged=1; cannot_merge=2; duplicate_pairs_found=5; expected_line_savings=approximately 70 lines; mergeable=4; phase=5.3a; reasoning={\"how\": \"Line-by-line comparison of CSS properties between canonical and alias selectors\", \"what\": \"4 pairs with identical CSS can be merged; 2 pairs use different tokens and must stay separate\", \"why\": \"Accurate assessment needed before consolidation to avoid breaking different token usage\"}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_mcp_repair_2/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-16T10:57:31.908303+00:00_283a0a9e", "timestamp": "2026-01-16T10:57:31.908358+00:00"}
