{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-16 11:34:46 UTC] [Agent: Atlas] [Project: scribe_mcp_repair_2] Phase 5.7 Assessment: Systems already unified from earlier work  **Modal System:** \u2705 UNIFIED in _modal.css - .c-modal/.modal as base - .detail-modal extends base - .memory-detail-modal, .memory-form-modal, .delete-confirm-modal as modifiers  **Severity System:** \u2705 UNIFIED in _severity.css - Documented as FOUNDATION component - Uses design tokens from tokens.css - Canonical c-severity-* names with backward-compat aliases  **Spinner System:** \u2705 CONSOLIDATED - .spinner, .spinner-sm, .spinner-lg in base-utilities.css - .spinner-small is documented legacy alias (kept for backward compat)  Phase 5.7 effectively COMPLETE - moving to Phase 5.8 | priority=medium; tags=[\"phase-5.7\", \"unification\", \"complete\"]; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_mcp_repair_2/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-16T11:34:46.627268+00:00_b4bb52cf", "timestamp": "2026-01-16T11:34:46.627330+00:00"}
