{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-16 11:35:26 UTC] [Agent: Atlas] [Project: scribe_mcp_repair_2] \ud83c\udf89 PHASE 5 COMPLETE: Deep Cleanup & Standardization  **Final Results:** - audit.css: 488 lines \u2705 (target: <500) - memories.css: 336 lines \u2705 (target: <500)  **All Phases Completed:** - 5.1: Critical Cleanup (277 lines removed) - 5.2: Token Compliance (200+ replacements) - 5.3: Alias Consolidation (~400 lines removed) - 5.4: Extract from Utilities (2 components, 278 lines) - 5.5: Extract from Page Files (4 components, 948 lines) - 5.6: Media Query Consolidation (141 lines moved) - 5.7: System Unification (already unified) - 5.8: Naming Standardization (c-* prefixes applied during extractions)  **New Components Created:** - _audit-card.css, _timeline.css, _three-panel.css - _type-pills.css, _memory-card.css, _reflection-graph.css, _fab.css  **Architecture Achievement:** - 8-layer ITCSS maintained - All components use c-* canonical naming - Backward-compatible aliases preserved - Design tokens used throughout | priority=medium; tags=[\"phase-5\", \"complete\", \"milestone\"]; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_mcp_repair_2/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-16T11:35:26.373435+00:00_bdcf756b", "timestamp": "2026-01-16T11:35:26.373477+00:00"}
{"op": "commit", "ref_id": "2026-01-16T11:35:26.373435+00:00_bdcf756b", "timestamp": "2026-01-16T11:35:26.383326+00:00"}
{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-16 11:43:07 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: scribe_mcp_repair_2] Fixed terse scope_violation messages in progress logs. Added _build_descriptive_message() helper to sentinel_tools.py that creates human-readable messages like \"Scope violation: absolute_path_not_allowlisted ; path=.../file.py\" instead of just \"scope_violation\". Also handles read_file_error and generic events with reason/error/title fallbacks. | files_changed=[\"tools/sentinel_tools.py\"]; fix_type=ux_improvement; reasoning={\"how\": \"Added _build_descriptive_message() that extracts reason/path/tool_name from data dict and formats readable message\", \"what\": \"append_event in project mode was using event_type as message fallback instead of building descriptive message from data\", \"why\": \"Scope violation entries in progress logs showed just 'scope_violation' as message with all details in metadata - unhelpful for quick scanning\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_mcp_repair_2/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-16T11:43:07.374795+00:00_2a0d5932", "timestamp": "2026-01-16T11:43:07.374838+00:00"}
